Dewa

524
00:39:50.788 --> 00:39:51.789
Penjaga Domba

525
00:39:54.892 --> 00:40:06.504
Berkah besar Dinasti Xia bersifat abadi

526
00:40:12.943 --> 00:40:24.588
Berkah besar Dinasti Xia bersifat abadi

527
00:40:35.199 --> 00:40:46.544
Berkah besar Dinasti Xia bersifat abadi

528
00:40:53.083 --> 00:40:55.619
Tuhan datang ke bumi

529
00:40:57.588 --> 00:41:01.392
Apakah dia benar-benar takdirnya?

530
00:41:20.144 --> 00:41:20.744
Apa

531
00:41:21.345 --> 00:41:22.346
Penjagaan domba

532
00:41:22.713 --> 00:41:23.347
Tuhan

533
00:41:23.347 --> 00:41:24.381
Berjalan seperti kawanan burung bangau

534
00:41:25.182 --> 00:41:26.383
Tubuh manusia kepala domba

535
00:41:26.951 --> 00:41:28.319
Itu adalah simbol dewa domba

536
00:41:29.720 --> 00:41:30.421
Dewa Gembala

537
00:41:30.421 --> 00:41:31.355
kata beku

538
00:41:31.722 --> 00:41:32.790
Inilah tuhan yang sebenarnya

539
00:41:33.457 --> 00:41:35.159
Karakter Musim Panas Genkou Sougen

540
00:41:35.426 --> 00:41:36.627
Fupinghou Yeli Renrong

541
00:41:36.627 --> 00:41:37.795
Dibuat menjadi dua belas jilid buku nasional

542
00:41:37.795 --> 00:41:38.629
Dinamakan Wenhai

543
00:41:38.829 --> 00:41:40.531
Dewa pemelihara domba tercatat dengan jelas

544
00:41:40.831 --> 00:41:42.533
Meskipun Daxia menghormati agama Buddha

545
