548
00:41:49.640 --> 00:41:50.674
melihatnya sendiri

549
00:41:51.108 --> 00:41:52.276
Belum tentu benar

550
00:41:52.276 --> 00:41:53.043
Yang Mulia

551
00:41:53.811 --> 00:41:55.412
